sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Platform Management
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ReportsPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewPlatformReportBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewPlatformReportController
  participant PlatformReportGenerator as «control»<br/>PlatformReportGenerator
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant ProjectView as «entity»<br/>ProjectView
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant Enquiry as «entity»<br/>Enquiry
  participant IssueReport as «entity»<br/>IssueReport
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: daily, weekly and monthly reports
  UI->>B: GET /api/management/reports (JWT)
  B->>C: view(ReportPeriodType period, LocalDate date)
  C->>PlatformReportGenerator: generate(period, date)
  PlatformReportGenerator->>Category: findAllSorted()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>InteriorDesignProject: countCreatedByCategory()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>ProjectView: countBetween()
  ProjectView->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectView: rows
  ProjectView-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>ProjectView: topViewed()
  ProjectView->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectView: rows
  ProjectView-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>Favourite: countSavedBetween()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>User: countRegistrationsByRole()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>Enquiry: countCreatedBetween()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator->>IssueReport: countCreatedByStatus()
  IssueReport->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>IssueReport: rows
  IssueReport-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator-->>C: PlatformReport
  C-->>B: PlatformReport
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result